[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1380.31, "timestamp": "00:23:00", "text": "但是，我想这应该是有可能的。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1391.19, "timestamp": "00:23:11", "text": "找到匹配项。我们可以趁我的时候做这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1393.87, "timestamp": "00:23:13", "text": "在我们排队的时候完成，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1397.43, "timestamp": "00:23:17", "text": "某物。其中71%的人赞同。所以，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1400.149, "timestamp": "00:23:20", "text": "不会把它放到上传页面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1408.31, "timestamp": "00:23:28", "text": "我会等待。我什么时候可以上传？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1409.789, "timestamp": "00:23:29", "text": "然后？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1412.669, "timestamp": "00:23:32", "text": "哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1416.23, "timestamp": "00:23:36", "text": "不。我应该同时上传这两个视频流吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1425.27, "timestamp": "00:23:45", "text": "然后？好的。我不知道。我会 我会"}]